      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RONALDO VELLA (1) steps out for the first time at this circuit. In the money last start when third (24.76) at Goulburn over 440m. Comes out of a solid form race last start. Rates highly and will give a great sight. FASCINATE SAMUEL (8) has a strong record this track and trip with five wins and four placings from 12 starts. Placed last time (29.33) at this track in a Grade 4/5, finishing second and beaten 1.5 lengths. Can hit the frame with the right run. CLASSIC ETHICS (6) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing sixth (36.32) in a NG at Richmond. Solid record here winning eight races. Solid formlines coming through his last run. Can figure in the finish. MY CUPCAKE (3) cannot be ruled out.",
